Package: IBSmatch
Title: IBS-Based DNA-RNA Sample Matching
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Bingjie Zhu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Bingjie Zhu <bingjie.zhu@example.com>
Description: Provides functions to match DNA and RNA samples using Identity-by-State
    (IBS) similarity scores. Implements Reciprocal Best Hit (RBH) matching, threshold
    calculation, distribution visualisation, and audit of matched results against a
    gold-standard sample list.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports:
    ggplot2
